==Release information==
This card was one of five cards that could be pulled from Promo-A Vol. 13 packs; these were made available as part of the [[Raichu ex Drop Event]], which ran from October 6 to 16, 2025.

==Trivia==
===Origin===
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Machamp|49}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion.
*'''Hurricane Punch''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Skyridge|Machamp|H15}} from the {{TCG|Skyridge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

